104
00:02:00,350 --> 00:02:01,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Tenten!
— It looks like it's going to be interesting.</font>

105
00:02:17,030 --> 00:02:17,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Begin!</font>

106
00:02:18,420 --> 00:02:24,410
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Shikamaru Staggers?!</font>

107
00:02:18,420 --> 00:02:24,410
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Female Ninja's</font>

108
00:02:18,420 --> 00:02:24,410
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Heated Battle</font>

109
00:02:30,630 --> 00:02:32,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go for it, Tenten!</font>

110
00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:34,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Believe in your own strength, Tenten!</font>

111
00:02:35,130 --> 00:02:37,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're behind you, Tenten!</font>

112
00:02:38,010 --> 00:02:40,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Knock her with all your strength!</font>

113
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:41,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's good!</font>

114
00:02:41,890 --> 00:02:44,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cheer her on more, more,
more with passion, Lee!</font>

115
00:02:44,510 --> 00:02:45,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

116
00:02:46,310 --> 00:02:48,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These guys are noisy!</font>

117
00:02:56,900 --> 00:02:59,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That spacing is just what I'd expect
from Tenten,</font>

118
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:02,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">not too close, not too far.</font>

119
00:03:02,660 --> 00:03:05,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Attacks or defense,
she can respond to either one.</font>

120
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:06,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?</font>

121
00:03:08,330 --> 00:03:09,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please begin.</font>

122
00:03:12,420 --> 00:03:15,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you planning to wait out and
see how I make my move?</font>

123
00:03:15,380 --> 00:03:16,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me just tell you,</font>

124
00:03:16,630 --> 00:03:19,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">once I start my attack
you'll be over in a second.</font>

125
00:03:22,180 --> 00:03:24,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're trying to be cool and
see what I do first...</font>

126
00:03:25,220 --> 00:03:26,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A hundred years too early!</font>

127
00:03:27,720 --> 00:03:29,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't matter to me, come first.</font>

128
00:03:30,060 --> 00:03:31,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You said it...</font>

129
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:34,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I won't hold back.</font>

130
00:03:40,950 --> 00:03:41,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They missed?</font>

131
00:03:41,860 --> 00:03:43,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's impossible!</font>

132
00:03:43,110 --> 00:03:45,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?
Is that a warm-up?</font>

133
00:03:46,030 --> 00:03:49,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or are you scared and your aim is off?</font>

134
00:03:50,830 --> 00:03:53,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought I would enjoy it
a little bit more,</font>

135
00:03:53,620 --> 00:03:56,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but evidently it's not promising.</font>

136
00:03:57,920 --> 00:03:58,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

137
00:03:59,050 --> 00:04:01,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't believe Tenten's attack missed!</font>

138
00:04:01,630 --> 00:04:02,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's unbelievable indeed.</font>

139
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:05,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenten's weapons...</font>

140
00:04:06,220 --> 00:04:07,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">always hits the mark
ten out of ten times.</font>

141
00:04:08,100 --> 00:04:09,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There no reason for them to miss</font>

142
00:04:10,350 --> 00:04:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...
She didn't miss</font>

143
00:04:14,270 --> 00:04:15,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She was made to miss</font>

144
00:04:17,150 --> 00:04:20,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As always, she's being disagreeable.</font>

145
00:04:20,690 --> 00:04:21,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How foolish...</font>

146
00:04:22,700 --> 00:04:24,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How disgraceful!</font>

147
00:04:25,030 --> 00:04:25,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

148
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:27,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sand wins again.</font>

149
00:04:27,950 --> 00:04:30,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't know that yet.</font>

150
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We know.</font>

151
00:04:32,620 --> 00:04:35,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How?
How do we know?</font>

152
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:38,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Explain it so I understand!</font>

153
00:04:38,750 --> 00:04:42,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stupid... As if I'd do
such a bothersome thing.</font>

154
00:04:44,050 --> 00:04:46,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru said it so,
surely that's how it is.</font>

155
00:04:48,470 --> 00:04:51,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These guys are hard to understand.</font>

156
00:04:55,230 --> 00:04:56,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down...</font>

157
00:04:57,230 --> 00:04:59,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't let her get to you...</font>

158
00:05:00,730 --> 00:05:01,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One.</font>

159
00:05:02,610 --> 00:05:03,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two.</font>

160
00:05:04,740 --> 00:05:05,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three...</font>

161
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:08,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it's gonna get dodged,</font>

162
00:05:09,030 --> 00:05:10,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just have to make
it impossible to!</font>

163
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:16,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So she's measuring the spacing,
next one is going to be the big attack.</font>

164
00:05:18,880 --> 00:05:19,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get it...</font>

165
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, that fan is the secret.</font>

166
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:22,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If so...</font>

167
00:05:32,520 --> 00:05:34,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about... this?!</font>

168
00:05:54,580 --> 00:05:55,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

169
00:05:55,870 --> 00:05:57,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My flying weapons!</font>

170
00:05:58,250 --> 00:06:00,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is there a secret mechanism
in the fan...?</font>

171
00:06:02,420 --> 00:06:03,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...</font>

172
00:06:03,460 --> 00:06:04,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the first star.</font>

173
00:06:05,090 --> 00:06:06,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are two more.</font>

174
00:06:07,970 --> 00:06:09,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When the third star appears,</font>

175
00:06:10,640 --> 00:06:12,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you will lose.</font>

176
00:06:16,230 --> 00:06:17,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenten!</font>

177
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:21,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be taken in by
your opponent, be calm!</font>

178
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be calm!</font>

179
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:25,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know...</font>

180
00:06:25,530 --> 00:06:28,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee, I really intended to use
this in the main battle,</font>

181
00:06:28,490 --> 00:06:30,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">not the preliminary round...</font>

182
00:06:30,990 --> 00:06:32,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but it looks like I can't do it that way.</font>

183
00:06:39,460 --> 00:06:41,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's already going to use it?</font>

184
00:06:44,460 --> 00:06:46,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pulling out two scrolls?</font>

185
00:06:46,630 --> 00:06:48,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What does she intend to do?</font>

186
00:06:55,060 --> 00:06:58,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah! No matter what you do,
it won't work.</font>

187
00:07:03,860 --> 00:07:05,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rising Twin Dragons!</font>

188
00:07:26,630 --> 00:07:29,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you increase the amount,
it's still the same!</font>

189
00:07:31,220 --> 00:07:32,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Second star!</font>

190
00:07:40,640 --> 00:07:41,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not done yet!</font>

191
00:08:00,830 --> 00:08:01,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did I do it?</font>

192
00:08:17,890 --> 00:08:19,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Third star.</font>

193
00:08:25,100 --> 00:08:25,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She disappeared!</font>

194
00:08:28,860 --> 00:08:29,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where is she?</font>

195
00:08:31,610 --> 00:08:32,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm over here!</font>

196
00:08:33,150 --> 00:08:33,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...!</font>

197
00:08:50,670 --> 00:08:51,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art!</font>

198
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:54,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wind Scythe Jutsu!</font>

199
00:08:57,850 --> 00:08:58,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenten!</font>

200
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:12,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chakra is enfolded in that wind.</font>

201
00:09:13,110 --> 00:09:13,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

202
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:15,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenten fought well...</font>

203
00:09:16,820 --> 00:09:21,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But she won't be able to escape from
that twister.</font>

204
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:32,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-That's awful.</font>

205
00:09:33,210 --> 00:09:34,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenten...!</font>

206
00:09:35,470 --> 00:09:38,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How boring... really.</font>

207
00:09:40,430 --> 00:09:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think she completely intercepted
Tenten's weapon attacks.</font>

208
00:09:44,060 --> 00:09:45,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is ridiculous!</font>

209
00:09:46,060 --> 00:09:48,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on with her...?</font>

210
00:09:49,060 --> 00:09:52,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just like Shikamaru said,
it's the Sand's win.</font>

211
00:09:53,730 --> 00:09:55,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I said it.</font>

212
00:09:56,110 --> 00:09:59,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no reason for us to lose here.</font>

213
00:10:01,830 --> 00:10:05,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Land of Sand is to be feared...</font>

214
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:10,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Temari wins the fifth battle.</font>

215
00:10:12,750 --> 00:10:13,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no!</font>

216
00:10:29,730 --> 00:10:30,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nice catch.</font>

217
00:10:31,770 --> 00:10:33,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?!</font>

218
00:10:33,610 --> 00:10:37,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that something you do to
an opponent who fought to the utmost?!</font>

219
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're annoying!</font>

220
00:10:39,820 --> 00:10:41,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take that trash away already!</font>

221
00:10:42,950 --> 00:10:44,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop! Lee!</font>

222
00:10:44,450 --> 00:10:46,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Hurricane!</font>

223
00:10:47,620 --> 00:10:48,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

224
00:10:48,790 --> 00:10:50,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're just like you look...</font>

225
00:10:50,460 --> 00:10:52,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're dull too.</font>

226
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:53,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?!</font>

227
00:10:55,130 --> 00:10:55,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop! Lee!</font>

228
00:10:57,050 --> 00:10:57,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei!</font>

229
00:10:59,550 --> 00:11:00,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Temari.</font>

230
00:11:01,180 --> 00:11:04,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come up quick, you've been
declared the winner.</font>

231
00:11:05,220 --> 00:11:10,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't keep company with that awful looking
guy and his chaperone forever.</font>

232
00:11:10,850 --> 00:11:11,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?!</font>

233
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:23,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's enough, Lee.</font>

234
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:29,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gentlemen of Sand...</font>

235
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:33,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if I may give you
a word of warning.</font>

236
00:11:35,630 --> 00:11:37,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This kid is strong.</font>

237
00:11:37,710 --> 00:11:39,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should prepare yourselves.</font>

238
00:11:42,930 --> 00:11:45,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Picking a fight with the Sand...</font>

239
00:11:46,640 --> 00:11:50,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I absolutely wouldn't want to
do it with those guys.</font>

240
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:53,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-They're all awesome guys...</font>

241
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:01,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't lose to those guys!</font>

242
00:12:01,820 --> 00:12:02,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

243
00:12:03,530 --> 00:12:04,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sakura-chan.</font>

244
00:12:04,780 --> 00:12:07,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan... Are you okay already?</font>

245
00:12:08,160 --> 00:12:11,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Never mind that,
you should worry about yourself!</font>

246
00:12:11,830 --> 00:12:15,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Me? I don't have
an injury or anything.</font>

247
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:17,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not what I mean.</font>

248
00:12:17,670 --> 00:12:20,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you lose here, it's a point of dishonor.</font>

249
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:22,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'd be ashamed to face Sasuke-kun!</font>

250
00:12:22,970 --> 00:12:24,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yeah.</font>

251
00:12:25,140 --> 00:12:25,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And...</font>

252
00:12:27,390 --> 00:12:28,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks for earlier...</font>

253
00:12:29,350 --> 00:12:30,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

254
00:12:31,230 --> 00:12:32,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan!</font>

255
00:12:34,690 --> 00:12:36,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You did your hardest
to get here!</font>

256
00:12:36,940 --> 00:12:40,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll disgrace women if
you lose to that Sasuke-obsessed girl!</font>

257
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:44,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it weren't for your stupid cheering
at that time...</font>

258
00:12:45,860 --> 00:12:48,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would have been soundly
beaten by Ino.</font>

259
00:12:49,290 --> 00:12:50,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, that's right.</font>

260
00:12:51,580 --> 00:12:52,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You!</font>

261
00:12:52,460 --> 00:12:52,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">sanAbivcmHHLLP</font></font></b></font>

