503
00:13:02,460 --> 00:13:04,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Nara Shikamaru</font></font></b></font>

504
00:13:02,460 --> 00:13:04,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Tsuchi Kin</font></font></b></font>

505
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:06,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

506
00:13:07,180 --> 00:13:08,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's me.</font>

507
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:11,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru, don't lose!</font>

508
00:13:12,270 --> 00:13:14,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Show us that you're a real man!
— All right, all right.</font>

509
00:13:14,690 --> 00:13:17,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get her with the 16 combo, go!</font>

510
00:13:17,860 --> 00:13:20,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Win, Shikamaru!
— Ino's become super energetic.</font>

511
00:13:20,860 --> 00:13:23,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You go for it!</font>

512
00:13:23,740 --> 00:13:25,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy manipulates shadows.</font>

513
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:27,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful of the shadows...</font>

514
00:13:30,490 --> 00:13:33,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't be beaten by
a stupid technique like that.</font>

515
00:13:36,870 --> 00:13:37,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru!</font>

516
00:13:37,920 --> 00:13:40,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bash that one around!
And while you're at it...</font>

517
00:13:40,880 --> 00:13:42,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, what a pain.</font>

518
00:13:43,300 --> 00:13:45,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Furthermore, my opponent is a woman...
It's hard to get to it.</font>

519
00:13:46,930 --> 00:13:49,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's what you think,
I'll end this quickly.</font>

520
00:13:49,350 --> 00:13:50,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go, go! Shikamaru!</font>

521
00:13:50,970 --> 00:13:54,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, you could say that
I know these guys' raw power</font>

522
00:13:54,850 --> 00:13:56,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from that incident from the second test...</font>

523
00:14:00,150 --> 00:14:03,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know anything about this one's Jutsu.</font>

524
00:14:05,860 --> 00:14:09,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On top of that, she's seen my Jutsu...</font>

525
00:14:10,280 --> 00:14:12,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— The sixth battle.
— That being said, for me...</font>

526
00:14:12,830 --> 00:14:14,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru versus Kin!</font>

527
00:14:15,450 --> 00:14:16,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Begin!</font>

528
00:14:16,830 --> 00:14:18,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can only do this.</font>

529
00:14:18,790 --> 00:14:20,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One trick pony, huh...?</font>

530
00:14:21,130 --> 00:14:21,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

531
00:14:23,170 --> 00:14:25,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art, Shadow Possession Jutsu!</font>

532
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:26,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Jutsu!</font>

533
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:30,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's nothing if I just pay attention
to the movement of your shadow!</font>

534
00:14:37,730 --> 00:14:38,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bells...?</font>

535
00:14:40,020 --> 00:14:42,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh, that's a classic.</font>

536
00:14:43,020 --> 00:14:45,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next, you'll throw Senbons with bells</font>

537
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:47,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and Senbons without bells
at the same time, right?</font>

538
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:53,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll respond to the sound of the bells,
intending to dodge them.</font>

539
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:57,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I won't notice the quiet Senbons,
and, ouch.</font>

540
00:14:59,120 --> 00:14:59,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that right?</font>

541
00:15:00,620 --> 00:15:02,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a chatty guy!</font>

542
00:15:02,210 --> 00:15:05,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So in order to not get caught
by the shadow Senbons...</font>

543
00:15:05,090 --> 00:15:06,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm alert to the trick
and look closely...</font>

544
00:15:09,260 --> 00:15:09,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

545
00:15:10,550 --> 00:15:11,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Behind?!</font>

546
00:15:16,520 --> 00:15:17,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">String?</font>

547
00:15:18,730 --> 00:15:20,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Damn it!
— Too late!</font>

548
00:15:22,400 --> 00:15:23,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru!</font>

549
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:25,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He took that pretty bad.</font>

550
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:27,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It wasn't that bad, look closely.</font>

551
00:15:27,820 --> 00:15:28,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

552
00:15:28,610 --> 00:15:31,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">F-For the moment I dodged a fatal hit.</font>

553
00:15:32,910 --> 00:15:34,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now it's my turn!</font>

554
00:15:34,740 --> 00:15:36,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not going to happen.</font>

555
00:15:46,300 --> 00:15:48,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's this?</font>

556
00:15:54,800 --> 00:15:59,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That happens to anyone
who hears my bell.</font>

557
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:03,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The sound vibration of
this special bell</font>

558
00:16:03,520 --> 00:16:06,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">reaches the brain directly
from the ear drum.</font>

559
00:16:07,110 --> 00:16:09,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then it will make you hallucinate.</font>

560
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:14,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's useless!</font>

561
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:17,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't avoid the sound of
my bell by doing...</font>

562
00:16:17,280 --> 00:16:21,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that... that... that... that... that...</font>

563
00:16:21,460 --> 00:16:24,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap! Which one?
Which is the real one?</font>

564
00:16:25,830 --> 00:16:27,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't do anything, can you?</font>

565
00:16:28,090 --> 00:16:33,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your shadow, which was your faint hope,
doesn't even know where to stretch to...</font>

566
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:39,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... I'll cook you slowly.</font>

567
00:16:41,980 --> 00:16:43,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Taking me lightly...!</font>

568
00:16:49,190 --> 00:16:52,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time it's five,
next time seven...</font>

569
00:16:53,030 --> 00:16:56,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll continue until you become
a hedgehog.</font>

570
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:59,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You're lying, you brat!</font>

571
00:16:59,240 --> 00:16:59,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

572
00:17:00,490 --> 00:17:02,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'd end it soon...</font>

573
00:17:02,080 --> 00:17:03,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what you said
in the beginning, isn't it?</font>

574
00:17:04,410 --> 00:17:08,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, you can't endure the pain
and want to be eased.</font>

575
00:17:10,130 --> 00:17:12,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I'll finish it here.</font>

576
00:17:14,050 --> 00:17:15,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's your death warrant.</font>

577
00:17:20,430 --> 00:17:21,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What?!</font>

578
00:17:23,020 --> 00:17:24,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">M-My body...</font>

579
00:17:27,440 --> 00:17:30,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At last, Shadow Possession Jutsu
is a success.</font>

580
00:17:31,690 --> 00:17:33,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What are you saying?</font>

581
00:17:33,690 --> 00:17:36,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!
Your shadow isn't anywhere...</font>

582
00:17:37,360 --> 00:17:39,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't realize it yet?</font>

583
00:17:39,700 --> 00:17:41,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-It can't be...</font>

584
00:17:42,240 --> 00:17:44,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just that, you fool!</font>

585
00:17:45,460 --> 00:17:49,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A thread at this height
can't have a shadow.</font>

586
00:17:49,840 --> 00:17:53,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can stretch and shrink
my own shadow.</font>

587
00:17:55,090 --> 00:17:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The shadow is gradually getting thicker.</font>

588
00:17:58,050 --> 00:18:00,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This wasn't the shadow of the thread...</font>

589
00:18:00,430 --> 00:18:03,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right. I stretched my shadow
and made it narrow,</font>

590
00:18:03,140 --> 00:18:06,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so it looked like the shadow of
a thread and stuck it on you.</font>

591
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:13,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... How do you win with that?</font>

592
00:18:13,980 --> 00:18:16,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm just gonna move
the same way as you.</font>

593
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:17,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Annoying.</font>

594
00:18:17,740 --> 00:18:19,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be quiet and watch.</font>

595
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:26,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stupid!</font>

596
00:18:27,710 --> 00:18:29,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you continue like this and attack...</font>

597
00:18:29,790 --> 00:18:32,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, too,
will be wounded!</font>

598
00:18:33,590 --> 00:18:35,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that.</font>

599
00:18:36,510 --> 00:18:37,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way! You're...!</font>

600
00:18:38,630 --> 00:18:40,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're gonna throw shuriken
at each other.</font>

601
00:18:40,340 --> 00:18:41,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How far will we go...?</font>

602
00:18:41,680 --> 00:18:42,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fool, stop it!</font>

603
00:18:49,440 --> 00:18:50,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're only talk...</font>

604
00:18:52,860 --> 00:18:54,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that one's a goner.</font>

605
00:18:56,280 --> 00:18:57,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're a Shinobi,</font>

606
00:18:57,440 --> 00:19:00,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you have to grasp the situation
and the layout when you battle.</font>

607
00:19:01,030 --> 00:19:03,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though we made
the same movements...</font>

608
00:19:03,580 --> 00:19:08,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the distance of the walls behind
each of us was different.</font>

609
00:19:09,210 --> 00:19:10,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just used the shuriken and</font>

610
00:19:10,790 --> 00:19:14,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">called attention away
from the wall behind us.</font>

611
00:19:15,670 --> 00:19:17,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Winner! Nara Shikamaru.</font>

612
00:19:18,050 --> 00:19:20,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good job Shikamaru!</font>

613
00:19:20,300 --> 00:19:21,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cool!</font>

614
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:22,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me next...</font>

615
00:19:22,680 --> 00:19:25,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me next... Me next...!</font>

616
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:29,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy's dull and plain,
but that was kinda cool.</font>

617
00:19:29,940 --> 00:19:30,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap!</font>

618
00:19:31,600 --> 00:19:34,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the only one left.</font>

